type: software
title: "PIM-Cleanser: In-Memory Acceleration of Data-Intensive Confidential Data Sanitization"
abstract: >
  Reproducible artifact for PIM-Cleanser: fixed-transcript zero and mean data
  repair for confidential processing-in-memory, with host-native quality
  evaluation, calibrated performance modeling, UCI HAR tooling, exact native
  calibration inputs, and separately promoted native gem5 evidence.
